quer"},{"start":181.268,"end":182.771,"text":"Unto victory we plead."}],"start":165.664,"end":182.771},{"key":"11","lines":[{"start":184.541,"end":186.186,"text":"Thou we praise for Barnabbas"},{"start":186.806,"end":188.139,"text":"Who in love forsaken"},{"start":188.759,"end":190.554,"text":"Worldly pleasures and treasures"},{"start":191.174,"end":192.62,"text":"The sublime he thus seek"},{"start":193.24,"end":194.937,"text":"While the mundane earth groweth"},{"start":195.557,"end":197.11,"text":"Descend on us Thine spirit"},{"start":197.73,"end":199.71,"text":"We plead Lord, may Thine comfort"},{"start":200.33,"end":201.889,"text":"The whole world overwhelm."}],"start":184.541,"end":201.889},{"key":"12","lines":[{"start":203.659,"end":205.362,"text":"Thou we praise for the Baptist"},{"start":205.982,"end":207.343,"text":"Fore-runner of the lord"},{"start":207.963,"end":209.309,"text":"Elijah for real is he"},{"start":209.929,"end":211.526,"text":"Making Jesus way plain"},{"start":212.146,"end":213.732,"text":"Greatest prophet we hail thee"},{"start":214.352,"end":215.919,"text":"His blessed morning witness"},{"start":216.539,"end":217.926,"text":"Make us blessed we plead"},{"start":218.546,"end":220.077,"text":"Thee As for Thine day we hope."}],"start":203.659,"end":220.077},{"key":"13","lines":[{"start":221.847,"end":223.467,"text":"Thou we praise for Saint Peter"},{"start":224.087,"end":225.535,"text":"Of them all he's so brave"},{"start":226.155,"end":227.561,"text":"But in trial denied Him"},{"start":228.181,"end":229.642,"text":"Thrice in remorse he went"},{"start":230.262,"end":231.878,"text":"In fellowship with the priests"},{"start":232.498,"end":234.164,"text":"To nuture the flock of Christ"},{"start":234.784,"end":236.419,"text":"Words of courage he giveth"},{"start":237.039,"end":238.461,"text":"And thus growing in zeal."}],"start":221.847,"end":238.461},{"key":"14","lines":[{"start":240.231,"end":241.848,"text":"Thou we praise for Thy servant"},{"start":242.468,"end":243.861,"text":"Who's slain of King Herod"},{"start":244.481,"end":246.064,"text":"The cup of His sufferings drank"},{"start":246.684,"end":248.132,"text":"His words He fulfilleth"},{"start":248.752,"end":250.318,"text":"Let us never in haste be"},{"start":250.938,"end":252.368,"text":"But patiently waiting still"},{"start":252.988,"end":254.629,"text":"Rejoicing in all sufferings"},{"start":255.249,"end":256.574,"text":"If Thou beckon on us."}],"start":240.231,"end":256.574},{"key":"15","lines":[{"start":258.344,"end":260.006,"text":"Thou we praise for Barthlomeu"},{"start":260.626,"end":261.922,"text":"The sincere disciple"},{"start":262.542,"end":264.201,"text":"Who Jesus glory beheld"},{"start":264.821,"end":266.15,"text":"Beneath the tree of fig"},{"start":266.77,"end":268.564,"text":"Lord make us sincere we plead"},{"start":269.184,"end":270.784,"text":"Christian bonafide truly"},{"start":271.404,"end":273.016,"text":"We plead Thee come dwell with us"},{"start":273.636,"end":275.112,"text":"And feed our fainting soul."}],"start":258.344,"end":275.112},{"key":"16","lines":[{"start":276.882,"end":278.582,"text":"Thou we praise for Saint Matthew"},{"start":279.202,"end":280.75,"text":"Who of Thine birth fore-told"},{"start":281.37,"end":283.018,"text":"Worldly treasures forsaken"},{"start":283.638,"end":285.149,"text":"The path of life he chose"},{"start":285.769,"end":287.589,"text":"We plead, our soul deliver"},{"start":288.209,"end":289.884,"text":"From all earthly desires"},{"start":290.504,"end":292.039,"text":"To Thine call may we harken"},{"start":292.659,"end":294.126,"text":"Let's rise and follow Thee."}],"start":276.882,"end":294.126},{"key":"17","lines":[{"start":295.896,"end":297.456,"text":"Thou we praise for physician"},{"start":298.076,"end":299.456,"text":"For the gospel he brought"},{"start":300.076,"end":301.58,"text":"Reveal Thee as Physicran"},{"start":302.2,"end":303.585,"text":"Co-bearer of our pains"},{"start":304.205,"end":305.604,"text":"Anoint us for Thine healing"},{"start":306.224,"end":308.083,"text":"Unto us all our souls Minister"},{"start":308.703,"end":309.954,"text":"Thine priceless balm"},{"start":310.574,"end":312.172,"text":"Unto us, all our lives."}],"start":295.896,"end":312.172},{"key":"18","lines":[{"start":313.942,"end":315.555,"text":"Unto Thine saint disciples"},{"start":316.175,"end":317.694,"text":"We praise Thee oh our Lord"},{"start":318.314,"end":320.07,"text":"By Love their souls inspired"},{"start":320.69,"end":322.237,"text":"Sacred path all to trod"},{"start":322.857,"end":324.407,"text":"May we thus be inspired"},{"start":325.027,"end":326.502,"text":"The Lord Jesus exalt"},{"start":327.122,"end":328.558,"text":"May we in love united"},{"start":329.178,"end":330.453,"text":"Abode of rest to dwell."}],"start":313.942,"end":330.453},{"key":"19","lines":[{"start":332.223,"end":333.901,"text":"Apostle, Prophet, Martyr"},{"start":334.521,"end":335.904,"text":"The Holy band divine"},{"start":336.524,"end":338.232,"text":"Rending their hymns ceaselessly"},{"start":338.852,"end":340.468,"text":"Decked in robes white as snow"},{"start":341.088,"end":342.589,"text":"For all the saints departed"},{"start":343.209,"end":345.042,"text":"We praise Thee oh Lord our God"},{"start":345.662,"end":347.476,"text":"Their footsteps towing, troding"},{"start":348.096,"end":349.421,"text":"Worshipping Thee alone."}],"start":332.223,"end":349.421},{"key":"20","lines":[{"start":351.191,"end":352.718,"text":"Praises to Father above"},{"start":353.338,"end":354.739,"text":"And unto God the son"},{"start":355.359,"end":356.775,"text":"Also to Holy Spirit"},{"start":357.395,"end":358.758,"text":"Sacred Trinity God"},{"start":359.378,"end":361.11,"text":"Redeemed saints and disciples"},{"start":361.73,"end":363.155,"text":"Shall bow down before Thee"},{"start":363.775,"end":365.332,"text":"To Thee all honour and strength"},{"start":365.952,"end":367.516,"text":"And glory, God to thee."},{"start":368.136,"end":368.822,"text":"Amen."}],"start":351.191,"end":368.822}]},"daniel":{"file":"en-354-daniel.m4a","bytes":3446266,"sha256":"46f7329f9917862072c17fd53c8ff0f72dd6f82355dc75acb5c7efeeccf72502","duration":367.596,"segments":[{"key":"1","lines":[{"start":0.35,"end":1.708,"text":"CONGREGATION in respite"},{"start":2.328,"end":3.722,"text":"We all church of the world"},{"start":4.342,"end":5.858,"text":"All praises we offer Thee"},{"start":6.478,"end":8.064,"text":"Christ Jesus Blessed Lord"},{"start":8.684,"end":10.4,"text":"Holy Lord Thou art conquered"},{"start":11.02,"end":12.501,"text":"That they may also conquer"},{"start":13.121,"end":14.739,"text":"The light of their glorious crown"},{"start":15.359,"end":16.711,"text":"Ordained from Thee above."}],"start":0.35,"end":16.711},{"key":"2","lines":[{"start":18.481,"end":20.16,"text":"Thou we praise for Saint Andrew"},{"start":20.78,"end":22.383,"text":"Who Thine voice first he hark"},{"start":23.003,"end":24.608,"text":"Whose brethren hath he brought"},{"start":25.228,"end":26.948,"text":"Forth Christ Jesus all to see"},{"start":27.569,"end":29.184,"text":"Set apart our hearts oh Lord"},{"start":29.804,"end":31.406,"text":"Let‘s on the watch be for Thee"},{"start":32.026,"end":33.594,"text":"And all our brethren also"},{"start":34.214,"end":35.588,"text":"Thine return to witness."}],"start":18.481,"end":35.588},{"key":"3","lines":[{"start":37.358,"end":39.089,"text":"Thou we praise for Saint Thomas"},{"start":39.709,"end":41.123,"text":"Thine be-ing doth he doubt"},{"start":41.743,"end":43.418,"text":"Our faith he thus establish"},{"start":44.038,"end":45.565,"text":"Thine divine love revealed"},{"start":46.185,"end":48.027,"text":"Oh dear Lord Thine peace we plead"},{"start":48.647,"end":50.029,"text":"To all who Thee expecting"},{"start":50.649,"end":52.059,"text":"Knowmg Thee as all faithful"},{"start":52.679,"end":54.207,"text":"And divine being of God."}],"start":37.358,"end":54.207},{"key":